header: "---\nname: jake-x-x-repurpose\ndescription: \"Turn one long asset - a YouTube video, podcast, newsletter, blog post, transcript, LinkedIn post or client call - into a week of X posts and one thread. Use when the user says \\\"repurpose this\\\", \\\"turn this into tweets\\\", \\\"I have a video/newsletter/transcript\\\", or pastes a long piece of content and wants it on X.\"\nlicense: MIT\nmetadata:\n  upstream_repository: Jakeschincariol/x-agent-skill\n  upstream_skill: x-repurpose\n  upstream_commit: 7822c29b4aedbd400b9339839d3f59f3652b1317\nprompt-source: prompt.toon\n---\n"
